# {{lb|en|historical}} {{synonym of|en|hundredman}}: a [[position]] in the [[Anglo-Saxon]] [[kingdom]]s [[oversee]]ing [[local]] [[administration]].
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} {{synonym of|en|hundred}}: a [[collection]] of [[100]] [[thing]]s.
# {{lb|en|obsolete|rare}} {{synonym of|en|centenarian}}: a [[person]] [[100]] or [[more]] [[year]]s [[old]].

